  "body": "## 描述\n\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\nIn Conv3DV2 tiling, unify block dimension selection and remove redundant reset. Replace the dual baseline/optimized tiling path with a single contract-aware selection. The optimized block dimensions are now validated for correctness and cost before being used for both convRunInfo and API tiling. Remove the ResetSingleCoreInfo method and consolidate SetSingleOutputShapeByMode into a single function that accepts the selected block dimensions. This ensures consistent single-core shape calculation and eliminates mixing of baseline/optimized values.\n\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\nRelated to [#2857](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/2857) \n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。-->\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n",
